From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Subject: [PATCH] luma: log windows that flash

A window flashing black at login was gone before anyone could see what it
was. The Shell now logs every window that closes within three seconds of
appearing, and every window opened in a session's first ninety seconds,
with its application, class, type, client and size.

